<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan feed group to tender up to 112,000T corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan feed group to tender up to 112,000T corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Members Feed Industry Group will tender on Thursday for two shipments of U.S. No.2 or Argentine corn, with each shipment ranging between 54,000 and 56,000 tonnes, traders said on Wednesday. </p>
<p>The feed group's main buyers are Taiwan's Formosa Oilseed, Fomau Cereal, Morn Sun Feed Mill and Shin Tai Industry.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>		U.S. Gulf     Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> 54-56,000  May 1-15	May 16-30</p>
<p> 54-56,000  June 16-30    July 1-15</p>
<p>-- or --</p>
<p> Tonnage    Date/Location</p>
<p>		Argentine ports</p>
<p>54-56,000  April 26 -May 15 54-56,000  June 10-30</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
